{
  "title": "Dua Allahumma Asleh اَللّٰهُمَّ أَصْلِحْ عَبْدَكَ",
  "code": "02",
  "data": "Dua-e-Allahumma Asleh\r\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَصْلِحْ عَبْدَكَ وَ خَلِیْفَتَكَ \r\nO Allah! Reform conditions of Your servant and caliph \r\nبِمَا اَصْلَحْتَ بِهٖ اَنْبِیَآئَكَ وَ رُسُلَكَ \r\nwith those means by which You have reformed conditions of Your messengers and prophets. \r\nوَ حُفَّهٗ بِمَلٰئِكَتِكَ وَاَیِّدْهُ بِرُوْحِ الْقُدُسِ مِنْ عِنْدِكَ \r\nSurround him with the angels and support him with the Holy Spirit. \r\nوَاسْلُكْهُ مِنْۢ بَیْنِ یَدَیْهِ وَ مِنْ خَلْفِهٖ رَصَدًا \r\nAppoint protectors from the front and behind him, \r\nیَحْفَظُوْنَهٗ مِنْ كُلِّ سُوْءٍ  وَ اَبْدِلْهُ مِنْۢ بَعْدِ خَوْفِهٖ اَمْنًا، \r\n(those) who would guard him from all troubles and calamities. Convert his fear into security, \r\nیَعْبُدُكَ لَا یُشْرِكُ بِكَ شَیْئًا، \r\n(so that) he may worship only You and doesn't associate anybody with You. \r\nوَ لَا تَجْعَلْ لِاَحَدٍ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ عَلٰی وَلِیِّكَ سُلْطَانًا، \r\nDo not make any of Your creatures an authority over Your vicegerent. \r\nوَائْذَنْ لَهٗ فِیْ جِهَادِ عَدُوِّكَ وَعَدُوِّهٖ، \r\nPermit him to fight against Your enemies and his enemies \r\nوَاجْعَلْنِیْ مِنْ اَنْصَارِهٖ اِنَّكَ عَلٰی كُلِّ شَیْءٍ قَدِیْرٌ.\r\nand include me among his helpers. Surely You possess power over everything."
}
